      "on": "2026-08-20",
      "reason": "Bounded and known. The short path posts one reply, plays it once, and stops — no loop, no queue, ceiling of one clip under 700 characters. What is missing is the ability to interrupt that clip: speak() is async, never re-checks AMENTI_VOICE_ON after its await, and carries no AbortController, so toggling voice off during the ~20s render still yields one clip. The long path above STREAM_THRESHOLD goes through AmentiAudio, which has a real stop() with an abort. The repair is the code consolidation, not a patch — Amenti.voice.speak(text, {figure, register:'conversational', profile:'gabriel'}) inherits the brake, the abort and the fast opener and keys identically, since gabriel:700 exists in PROFILES for exactly that call. Deferred because Page2's speech has resisted two prior rebuilds; a surface that has defeated two attempts is saying the estimate is wrong. Revisit when Page2 is opened for another reason."
